  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As FPS limiting is now available in VRChat, it would be nice to have an additional option to limit framerate based on whether the game window is currently focused or not. This will be less relevant to VR and mobile users of course.\n\nThis would free up additional system resources for tasks such as working in apps like unity or blender. Perhaps even have VRChat open for voice while another game is being played?\n\nMy current work arounds are either change the fps limiter manually or squish the game window resolution down to ant mode and then maximise when needed.\n\nA minor request but would help my system use less power and generate less heat as well while I'm working on other tasks all that little more comfortably.",
